OL,3,AIsrael says senior Hamas member seized
OL,4,Aas strikes kill three during Gaza raid
OL,5,
OL,6,FIsrael's defence minister says a senior
OL,7,Fmember of the Palestinian armed group
OL,8,FHamas has been captured.
OL,10,FIsrael Katz was speaking after reports
OL,11,Fof a raid by Israeli special forces and
OL,12,Fan Israel-backed Palestinian militia in
OL,13,FGaza City.
OL,15,FIsraeli air strikes at the same time
OL,16,Fkilled at least two children and a
OL,17,Fwoman, local medics say.
OL,19,FA third child was killed in a separate
OL,20,Fincident in central Gaza.
